[1222]={["aftermath"]="Morgan confirmed that Ignatz brought the leaves and described the help he received.",["atomIDs"]={"1222:description:1-53","1222:description:58-140","1222:description:145-244","1222:description:247-278","1222:description:283-326","1222:description:328-351","1222:description:354-426","1222:objective:1-66"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1222:completion:5-105","1222:completion:110-123","1222:completion:125-222"},["opening"]="Morgan's search for bogbean leaves had stranded Ignatz among hostile swamp creatures. He needed protection both to find the plant and to get clear.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to escort Ignatz during the bogbean search.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the escort and reported to Morgan.",["sourceHash"]="7984560e26e4a09d830f8886ff2b39051909a3f5bd208f7f0153f9447baa41c3",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1238]={["aftermath"]="Nazeer identified Marg as its author and feared the recovered evidence might mark his death.",["atomIDs"]={"1238:description:1-68","1238:description:71-117","1238:description:120-163","1238:description:168-256","1238:description:261-370","1238:objective:1-66"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1238:completion:1-14","1238:completion:16-73","1238:completion:75-108","1238:completion:114-231"},["opening"]="The parchment in the severed hand's tube recorded weeks of spying on Theramore. Its contents pointed toward the spymaster at Brackenwall.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to return the recovered report to Nazeer.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the report to Nazeer.",["sourceHash"]="fc7259d52fca8297a25625627761b5c117b4422c4c91520248ee9698b57ae54d",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1239]={["aftermath"]="Nazeer confirmed that it was Marg, but could not yet tell whether a weapon or beast killed him.",["atomIDs"]={"1239:description:1-78","1239:description:81-146","1239:objective:1-70"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1239:completion:1-34","1239:completion:36-59","1239:completion:64-93","1239:completion:95-169","1239:completion:174-209","1239:completion:211-276"},["opening"]="Further digging uncovered an orc's raggedly severed head. Nazeer had to identify the remains before the lost agent's fate could be understood.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring the head to Nazeer.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the recovered head.",["sourceHash"]="06c1b7406c3e6ad5a91a8538f29478b1b96bcf1eb471246493e0470ee1ab8df7",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1240]={["aftermath"]="Kin'weelay found Marg's spirit still bound to the world by unfinished work.",["atomIDs"]={"1240:description:1-49","1240:description:52-121","1240:description:126-206","1240:description:211-278","1240:description:281-336","1240:objective:1-88"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1240:completion:1-14","1240:completion:16-102","1240:completion:107-152"},["opening"]="Nazeer sought an account no living witness had supplied. He sent Marg's head to Kin'weelay, hoping the witchdoctor could speak with the agent's spirit.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to take Marg's head to Grom'gol.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the head to Kin'weelay.",["sourceHash"]="09b08e78a144a018b55506201f6bb2ab11b00030a2d612130335e96add9a26e0",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1241]={["atomIDs"]={"1241:description:1-72","1241:description:74-101","1241:description:106-174","1241:description:176-273","1241:description:278-386","1241:description:391-452","1241:description:454-511","1241:objective:1-30"},["opening"]="A diplomat bound for Jaina Proudmoore had never reached Theramore. DeLavey suspected Defias involvement but lacked its shape; before the secret became public, he wanted Jorgen's contacts brought into the search.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to find Jorgen with DeLavey's note.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found Jorgen in Stormwind.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="10e4fb4c4a0ef00fb787d9d46c8156015fb8c7247dbc6eeae003e66cad94866b",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1242]={["atomIDs"]={"1242:description:1-36","1242:description:38-67","1242:description:69-111","1242:description:113-137","1242:description:142-245","1242:description:250-324","1242:description:326-335","1242:objective:1-64"},["bridge"]="The private inquiry had reached Jorgen. He sealed its next direction in a note to Elling Trias and urged the bearer to let the message speak.",["bridgeFrom"]=1241,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="Jorgen treated the sealed note as enough of an introduction. At Trias's cheese shop, discretion and patience were to speak more effectively than an explanation offered aloud.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to deliver Jorgen's Sealed Note to Elling Trias.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Jorgen's Sealed Note to Elling Trias.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="04911e74bda3513fc40c9d8c9daddf7409f1b6bc6a7c107a6722b99ce85f7a93",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1243]={["atomIDs"]={"1243:description:1-26","1243:description:28-64","1243:description:69-100","1243:description:102-154","1243:description:159-189","1243:description:191-283","1243:description:288-398","1243:description:400-511","1243:objective:1-51"},["bridge"]="Jorgen's note had reached Trias. He began working his contacts and sent the physical search toward Backus and the Defias activity around Darkshire.",["bridgeFrom"]=1242,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="Trias began using contacts while sending the footwork to Duskwood. Watcher Backus patrolled north of Darkshire and could report Defias activity to someone acting in the cheese seller's name.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring the Sealed Note to Watcher Backus.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Sealed Note to Watcher Backus.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="9f5e4341d19735192ecd1bceacffcc268990af3a42be4f4a16caccc055c05e9e",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1244]={["aftermath"]="Backus thought the docket official but still allowed that it could be a decoy. Its recovery had supplied evidence without yet establishing the complete plot.",["atomIDs"]={"1244:description:1-16","1244:description:18-111","1244:description:116-190","1244:description:192-288","1244:description:290-342","1244:description:347-414","1244:description:419-494","1244:objective:1-67"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1244:completion:1-27","1244:completion:29-76","1244:completion:81-113","1244:completion:115-182","1244:completion:184-271"},["opening"]="Backus remembered an unusual gathering at Addle's Stead weeks earlier. Defias activity was common enough to worry the Watch, but this sighting suggested something larger worth investigating at the farm.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to recover the Defias Docket from Addle's Stead.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the Defias Docket to Watcher Backus.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="2b3e763f1ce2fffec429ef90641488f5818b5a7f1f9a9069267596ebdd7f8c69",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1245]={["atomIDs"]={"1245:description:1-73","1245:description:75-116","1245:description:118-169","1245:description:171-207","1245:description:209-231","1245:description:233-280","1245:description:285-338","1245:description:340-444","1245:objective:1-53"},["bridge"]="The Defias Docket had reached Backus. Its complexity made him insist it return to Trias, while keeping his own part in the secret inquiry concealed.",["bridgeFrom"]=1244,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="The docket's complexity alarmed Backus beyond his own authority. He urged a swift return to Trias and asked that his assistance remain unmentioned to superiors who might punish the secrecy.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to take the Defias Docket to Trias.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Defias Docket to Elling Trias.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="41e2ffd996b47a7ca5291a5d8a14aad9ee0bc6c79eca774bba9ffdd3b1a21b1b",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1246]={["atomIDs"]={"1246:description:1-34","1246:description:36-44","1246:description:46-64","1246:description:66-83","1246:description:85-89","1246:description:91-107","1246:description:109-195","1246:description:200-273","1246:description:275-289","1246:description:291-379","1246:description:381-399","1246:description:401-507","1246:objective:1-39"},["opening"]="The papers pointed Trias toward Dashel Stonefist in Old Town. He expected the brawler to withhold what he knew and urged persuasion forceful enough to obtain an answer.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to speak with Dashel Stonefist.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Dashel Stonefist in Stormwind.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="5e1cb3ed7a2474e80b61d7c43612a94a978a1e60177e95f8892b5971f27d91c9",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1247]={["aftermath"]="Trias found the backup plan in the documents but still lacked the diplomat's name. Slim's connection to Menethil remained the usable next lead.",["atomIDs"]={"1247:description:1-10","1247:description:18-76","1247:description:78-111","1247:description:113-148","1247:description:150-187","1247:description:189-205","1247:description:210-287","1247:description:289-334","1247:objective:1-35"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1247:completion:1-35","1247:completion:37-75","1247:completion:80-297","1247:completion:302-428"},["opening"]="Dashel described a failed first plan and an inside man for a second. Slim of Menethil was the name he supplied for that backup, leaving the next report to Trias.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to bring Dashel's information back to Trias.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Elling Trias after Dashel's disclosure.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="9c1ba78a65bae846fb6936eaf014c7666f171d0228965c5f12c7a904eb9fd45f",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1248]={["atomIDs"]={"1248:description:1-73","1248:description:75-160","1248:description:162-181","1248:description:183-257","1248:description:262-367","1248:description:369-435","1248:description:437-510","1248:objective:1-33"},["bridge"]="Dashel's account had returned to Trias with the name Slim. The lead now crossed to Mikhail, a retired contact tending bar at Menethil.",["bridgeFrom"]=1247,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="Trias's retired contact Mikhail tended bar in Menethil. He could help trace Slim, where the docket itself said nothing about the captive's identity or destination after the capture.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to meet Mikhail in the Wetlands.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Mikhail in Menethil Harbor.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="ee4f143fb467ecfcd771df6e5759da7340324c3c1ed16b4096407c905f0c5906",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1249]={["aftermath"]="Mikhail recognized the captured man as Slim and reflected on the intrigue he thought he had left. His assistance restored a line of inquiry without yet revealing the captive's identity.",["atomIDs"]={"1249:description:1-29","1249:description:31-84","1249:description:86-113","1249:description:115-143","1249:description:148-166","1249:description:168-236","1249:description:241-316","1249:description:318-398","1249:description:400-485","1249:objective:1-77"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1249:completion:1-16","1249:completion:18-30","1249:completion:32-59","1249:completion:64-170","1249:completion:172-199","1249:completion:201-317","1249:completion:322-404","1249:completion:406-441"},["opening"]="Mikhail welcomed anyone sent by Elling, then noticed a man listening too closely by the exit. The suspicious patron might flee before a quiet inquiry could reach him.",["pending"]="{actor} would subdue Tapoke Jahn before he escaped and return to Mikhail.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the Tapoke Jahn subdual assignment and returned to Mikhail.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="34166f0d9c7340d87888a22f9b4e1983ad7566754411984ef21b5be40924731d",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1250]={["aftermath"]="Mikhail reacted to the king's identity with surprise and planned to alert Elling. Hendel became the next person the search needed to find.",["atomIDs"]={"1250:description:1-60","1250:description:62-80","1250:description:82-134","1250:description:136-243","1250:description:245-291","1250:description:293-321","1250:description:323-366","1250:description:371-456","1250:description:458-483","1250:description:485-502","1250:description:504-511","1250:objective:1-33"},["bridge"]="The suspicious listener had been caught. Jahn's account named the king as the captive and Hendel as the man placed aboard his ship, turning a diplomat's disappearance into a royal crisis.",["bridgeFrom"]=1249,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"1250:completion:1-10","1250:completion:12-20","1250:completion:22-30","1250:completion:32-45","1250:completion:47-61","1250:completion:63-124","1250:completion:126-206","1250:completion:211-246","1250:completion:248-286","1250:completion:291-367","1250:completion:369-430","1250:completion:435-469","1250:completion:471-503"},["opening"]="Jahn named the missing traveler as Stormwind's king, not an ordinary diplomat. He said the Defias served an unnamed partner and that his own part had placed Hendel aboard the royal ship.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to speak with Mikhail after Jahn's account.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Mikhail following Jahn's disclosure.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="f2184947b043f2d2eff0237fedafae6961946d7fc1e4a382cbeadabf1c458396",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1251]={["aftermath"]="Krog wondered whether the shield was a warning left by the arsonists, without reaching an answer.",["atomIDs"]={"1251:description:1-188","1251:description:193-248","1251:objective:1-63"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1251:completion:1-116","1251:completion:118-185","1251:completion:190-199","1251:completion:201-209"},["opening"]="A fire-blackened shield remained fixed to the ruined inn's chimney. Removed from the bricks, it offered Krog a physical clue from the blaze.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to show the shield to Krog.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the shield to Brackenwall.",["sourceHash"]="176d02134521dd2d41e7f3b94c8c3a8990b92c5aec5049145dd4c6d2aa23da70",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1252]={["atomIDs"]={"1252:description:1-75","1252:description:77-221","1252:description:226-294","1252:objective:1-58"},["opening"]="Ash and rubble concealed a Theramore badge embossed with Reethe's name. Vimes might be able to identify the man attached to this clue.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to carry Reethe's badge to Vimes.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the badge in Theramore.",["sourceHash"]="011de248b54110b2bb9a456d90be1c55ad869e43562eb642efe493c372b061bd",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1253]={["aftermath"]="Vimes saw an ordinary shield damaged by the blaze and acknowledged that craftsmanship was outside his expertise.",["atomIDs"]={"1253:description:1-188","1253:description:193-248","1253:objective:1-69"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1253:completion:1-58","1253:completion:60-96","1253:completion:101-195"},["opening"]="The shield on the inn's crumbling chimney survived the fire in blackened form. Vimes was to examine it as part of Theramore's investigation.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring the shield to Vimes.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the fire-damaged shield.",["sourceHash"]="89f6306b0600c82ad22274b71368dde0e9b89c438561fdc093fb6d0be98946ca",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1258]={["atomIDs"]={"1258:description:1-70","1258:description:73-156","1258:description:159-232","1258:description:237-341","1258:description:344-441","1258:description:456-481","1258:objective:1-60"},["opening"]="Presentation mattered as much as flavor in Morgan's next ingredient. Only unscarred crab legs from the distant Swamp of Sorrows would suit the dish.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather twelve pristine crawler legs.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the undamaged legs to Morgan.",["sourceHash"]="705e18868f0b175fa6b070694184b212deec53cce96e367174b95e6277c8c7e9",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1259]={["atomIDs"]={"1259:description:1-54","1259:description:56-109","1259:description:111-203","1259:description:208-288","1259:objective:1-62"},["opening"]="Vimes did not recognize Reethe's name. Theramore's personnel and equipment records were kept by Tesoran, making the adjutant the next lead.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to ask Tesoran about Reethe.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} consulted Tesoran's records inquiry.",["sourceHash"]="b699ef33458226108ea14c05a5f74d555c1dc2fb2621e3bf6bbb4482c46b2f80",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1260]={["aftermath"]="Morgan reported promising leads but needed help obtaining ingredients from the marsh.",["atomIDs"]={"1260:description:1-45","1260:description:48-104","1260:description:107-162","1260:description:167-247","1260:description:250-332","1260:description:337-366","1260:description:369-384","1260:description:387-461","1260:objective:1-37"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1260:completion:1-30","1260:completion:35-108","1260:completion:113-158"},["opening"]="Angus planned a marsh-inspired menu for the Blue Recluse. His nephew's recipe search in Theramore had gone far enough that he now wanted news.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to ask Morgan about his recipe research.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Morgan in Theramore.",["sourceHash"]="8687e8de2f93245a7d20487888b24f6161239d89f710401383793b5c808017b9",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1261]={["aftermath"]="Marg's death was explained, but the pendant's presence among common soldiers opened a new mystery.",["atomIDs"]={"1261:description:1-17","1261:description:20-39","1261:description:42-59","1261:description:62-88","1261:description:93-107","1261:description:110-120","1261:description:123-148","1261:description:153-231","1261:description:234-266","1261:description:268-328","1261:description:333-446","1261:description:451-507","1261:objective:1-59"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1261:completion:1-49","1261:completion:54-67","1261:completion:69-113","1261:completion:115-220"},["opening"]="Marg's spirit recounted stealing a richly jeweled pendant from an Alliance camp. A muckshell killed him on the return, leaving the object to be recovered.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover the pendant and bring it to Nazeer.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the pendant to Nazeer.",["sourceHash"]="dc97db34df0cecb4a0a859468fa33392d0107d01bf6e37fd45c0565e37b0679a",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1262]={["aftermath"]="Zor undertook further study without identifying the pendant's owner.",["atomIDs"]={"1262:description:1-78","1262:description:81-159","1262:description:164-287","1262:description:292-337","1262:description:340-455","1262:objective:1-55"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1262:completion:1-60","1262:completion:62-95","1262:completion:100-121","1262:completion:126-158","1262:completion:160-221"},["opening"]="Nazeer could not reconcile the noble pendant with its soldier bearer. He sent it to Zor for knowledge of Stormwind politics, leaving theft and disguise as possibilities.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to take the pendant to Zor.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the jeweled pendant in Orgrimmar.",["sourceHash"]="27fec8cbcc1abd6433097817c4a9c68ad915a64b0ee9d3dc8b608c94576ce489",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1264]={["atomIDs"]={"1264:description:1-111","1264:description:113-184","1264:description:186-287","1264:description:292-390","1264:description:392-484","1264:description:486-496","1264:objective:1-42"},["bridge"]="The revelation had reached Mikhail. He connected Hendel with visiting marines and directed the inquiry across the sea to Commander Samaul in Theramore.",["bridgeFrom"]=1250,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="Mikhail connected Hendel with Kul Tiras Marines who visited after payday. Commander Samaul in Theramore might locate the soldier, with Elling's name offered as a reason for discreet assistance.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to find Commander Samaul in Theramore.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Commander Samaul in Dustwallow Marsh.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="7b9b9795b96d6b8bc5540704707f10edfc25ae43a153410c987b6880f47515d9",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1265]={["aftermath"]="Tervosh explained that Hendel was elsewhere and that Proudmoore had sent him to aid the inquiry. He offered the location as a means of bringing the soldier to justice.",["atomIDs"]={"1265:description:1-7","1265:description:9-28","1265:description:30-71","1265:description:76-103","1265:description:105-140","1265:description:142-217","1265:description:219-324","1265:description:326-414","1265:description:419-489","1265:description:491-502","1265:objective:1-51"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1265:completion:1-55","1265:completion:57-145","1265:completion:147-209","1265:completion:211-309"},["opening"]="Samaul knew Hendel but feared what an inquiry from Elling might mean. He believed the soldier had been stationed at the first tower outside Theramore and asked caution in a matter touching the region's defense.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to search Sentry Point for signs of Hendel.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the Sentry Point inquiry with Archmage Tervosh.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="67b7c513447f8a7363beef2ff64e7b5606fa6b362833406f23a0b02f433bbd6a",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1266]={["atomIDs"]={"1266:description:1-38","1266:description:40-128","1266:description:130-249","1266:description:254-332","1266:description:337-412","1266:description:414-492","1266:objective:1-40"},["bridge"]="The search at Sentry Point had reached Tervosh rather than Hendel. The mage offered directions west toward the roadside tents where the soldier guarded resting infiltrators.",["bridgeFrom"]=1265,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="Tervosh placed Hendel farther west, guarding infiltrators resting beside the road. Their work concerned Brackenwall and other threats along Theramore's border.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to find Private Hendel in Dustwallow.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found Private Hendel in Dustwallow Marsh.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="c05b16ef5e646d7834a12ab71f82b89acfd46a3bb40a1f36081c6b3177850a4a",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1267]={["atomIDs"]={"1267:objective:1-45"},["availabilityQualification"]={["basis"]="Catalog states positive beta server experience; confirms reported definition, not that a player can reach its giver in the target release",["currentServerPlayableConfirmed"]=false,["eligibility"]="BETA_SERVER_DEFINED_PUBLISHER_CLAIM",["sourceReceipt"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639 ; https://tierhall.app/wow/quests/1267"},["fieldBlockers"]={"Description absent: motivation, conflict, stakes and reason for this audience are source-blocked; no invented continuation."},["opening"]="The next instruction called for a meeting with Jaina Proudmoore in Dustwallow. The brief directions gave no further account of what she wished to discuss.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to speak with Jaina Proudmoore in Dustwallow.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} met Jaina Proudmoore in Dustwallow.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="ab3ee8973b9d1a5e187e8b2d94e9e70d2806e1fb15d8b056e8e2013c32768b65",["sourceMapID"]="1453",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
