[1269]={["aftermath"]="Krog called Reethe a deserter and said Ogron had been sent to track him down.",["atomIDs"]={"1269:description:1-75","1269:description:77-217","1269:description:222-290","1269:objective:1-52"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1269:completion:1-32","1269:completion:34-61","1269:completion:63-129","1269:completion:134-168","1269:completion:170-233","1269:completion:235-283"},["opening"]="A Theramore insignia in the inn's rubble bore Reethe's name. Carried to Brackenwall, the badge might connect the ruined site to someone Krog knew.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to show Reethe's badge to Krog.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the badge to Krog.",["sourceHash"]="e50d94044b8a488d50c42ddfb13e0d299d4b7818393713c22add00bf9b7b83a1",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1270]={["aftermath"]="Mebok confirmed that Ignatz delivered the herbs and credited the assistance.",["atomIDs"]={"1270:description:1-54","1270:description:59-141","1270:description:146-243","1270:description:245-328","1270:description:333-391","1270:description:394-468","1270:objective:1-66"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1270:completion:1-89","1270:completion:91-100","1270:completion:102-142","1270:completion:147-245"},["opening"]="Mebok's paid herb search had left Ignatz surrounded in the marsh. Getting the bogbean required protection before he could return to his employer.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to escort Ignatz and report to Mebok.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the escort and reached Mebok.",["sourceHash"]="0a643583e2d66bf600540e461f16df7f1c5cbc230efd490399066caf3f376714",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1273]={["aftermath"]="Krog said Reethe died from an arrow wound and that this line of inquiry yielded no useful answer.",["atomIDs"]={"1273:description:1-40","1273:description:42-66","1273:description:71-135","1273:description:137-184","1273:objective:1-79"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1273:completion:1-5","1273:completion:7-174","1273:completion:179-263"},["opening"]="Ogron had finally located Reethe after a long search. He asked for company while seeking answers from a man he feared the swamp had unsettled.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to accompany Ogron and report to Krog.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the inquiry and returned to Krog.",["sourceHash"]="08aef6943f834fb1e86acca5dbc720cb3a63e5ecf2b53ac5a85990a97a7e2c51",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1274]={["atomIDs"]={"1274:description:1-27","1274:description:29-130","1274:description:135-264","1274:description:266-291","1274:description:293-326","1274:objective:1-38"},["opening"]="Thomas quietly recruited help for DeLavey's delicate matter. Stormwind Keep was the destination, with discretion requested before the substance of the problem was shared.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to meet Bishop DeLavey discreetly.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Bishop DeLavey in Stormwind Keep.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="97fa62279538a1ed9039443854fb7477c64205657a46c86c1b8489057473b2fe",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1275]={["atomIDs"]={"1275:description:1-44","1275:description:46-129","1275:description:134-193","1275:description:195-263","1275:description:268-382","1275:description:384-466","1275:description:471-494","1275:objective:1-63"},["opening"]="Gershala feared blood elves experimenting with demons might suffer a transformation like naga or satyrs. Brain stems from the creatures in Blackfathom could support his attempt to understand that possible fate.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to gather eight Corrupt Brain Stems for Gershala.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered eight Corrupt Brain Stems to Gershala Nightwhisper.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="794a794346538bbb3ff5a9005dfb271a74dafc3730c8e02db21be15b1bf17db9",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1276]={["aftermath"]="Mosarn confirmed his craftsmanship but could not recall enough about this particular shield to explain it.",["atomIDs"]={"1276:description:1-19","1276:description:21-75","1276:description:77-122","1276:description:127-203","1276:description:205-219","1276:description:224-280","1276:description:285-381","1276:objective:1-58"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1276:completion:1-31","1276:completion:33-61","1276:completion:66-124","1276:completion:126-209"},["opening"]="Krog recognized Mosarn's name from an earlier gift of armor. The Thunder Bluff smith might identify the shield even after Reethe's lead had failed.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to show the shield to Mosarn.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the shield to its maker.",["sourceHash"]="6a831ef59203f801504a0410c2d861de121498c1cef338ad29db59138353997b",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1282]={["aftermath"]="Vimes identified James Hyal and the burned Shady Rest Inn, then invited a search of its rubble because the investigation had stalled.",["atomIDs"]={"1282:description:1-50","1282:description:52-78","1282:description:80-136","1282:description:141-183","1282:description:185-237","1282:description:239-344","1282:objective:1-69"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1282:completion:1-27","1282:completion:29-72","1282:completion:74-130","1282:completion:135-204","1282:completion:206-277","1282:completion:282-401","1282:completion:403-449","1282:completion:451-511"},["opening"]="Byron remembered Jim before the loss of his marsh inn. He avoided the subject and directed further questions toward Vimes.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to speak with Vimes about Jim.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} met Vimes at Foothold Citadel.",["sourceHash"]="8c1ff145f69156dde624346b8f506ec4ec7ffb77350fc305cf2b95eb7dbde579",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1284]={["aftermath"]="Vimes noted centaur activity nearby and planned to send Falgran to follow the prints.",["atomIDs"]={"1284:description:1-83","1284:description:85-205","1284:objective:1-94"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1284:completion:1-15","1284:completion:17-124","1284:completion:126-214","1284:completion:219-313"},["opening"]="Rows of hoofprints faded into the marsh mud beyond the inn's smoking remains. Theramore's investigation gained a trail to follow from the ruins.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to report the hoofprints to Vimes.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} described the tracks to Vimes.",["sourceHash"]="979db29e85b2f4bad504c59d465aa2251a05f197f3f43a33bcde71b5ececb747",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
