[1323]={["aftermath"]="Krog found the name familiar but could not immediately place it, and cautioned that a shield alone might mean little.",["atomIDs"]={"1323:description:1-63","1323:description:65-91","1323:description:96-155","1323:description:157-175","1323:description:177-193","1323:description:195-217","1323:objective:1-38"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1323:completion:1-7","1323:completion:9-26","1323:completion:28-55","1323:completion:57-85","1323:completion:90-117","1323:completion:119-174"},["opening"]="Do'gol's cleaning had exposed a difficult name, perhaps Mosarn. He did not recognize it and sent the question back to Krog.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to ask Krog about the shield's inscription.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported the name to Krog.",["sourceHash"]="69eae74eb73f8fe7259e8a88723d2b554669eb259251727899f891e43d4fe9b1",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1324]={["aftermath"]="Tervosh proposed taking Hendel back to Theramore for questioning. The confrontation had secured a suspect, not yet found the missing king.",["atomIDs"]={"1324:description:1-6","1324:description:8-113","1324:description:115-172","1324:objective:1-42"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1324:completion:1-160","1324:completion:165-229","1324:completion:231-266"},["opening"]="Hendel met the accusation of Defias ties with anger rather than an explanation. The encounter at his Dustwallow post became a direct contest.",["pending"]="{actor} would defeat Private Hendel in the confrontation.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the assignment to defeat Private Hendel.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="214bbba840e0d82531b18cfcea7222f68521a6a439f940cf609fa0fc117b393e",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1338]={["atomIDs"]={"1338:description:1-58","1338:description:61-116","1338:description:119-166","1338:description:171-187","1338:description:189-256","1338:description:259-273","1338:description:276-338","1338:description:341-398","1338:description:403-511","1338:objective:1-58"},["opening"]="Stormpike wanted a shield from the armorsmith Furen Longbeard, whose work he admired. Furen lived far south in Stormwind's Dwarven District, so the request needed a traveler to carry it.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to take Stormpike's Request to Furen Longbeard.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Stormpike's Request to Furen Longbeard in Stormwind.",["sourceHash"]="9ba6561f292f29adf4a6509bd5c179ba72ec38761823d8d5ef89a0059d9a8519",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1339]={["atomIDs"]={"1339:description:1-53","1339:description:56-96","1339:description:99-111","1339:description:114-140","1339:description:145-217","1339:objective:1-33"},["opening"]="Kadrell had heard that Stormpike needed a runner for work away from his post. The mountaineer waited at the top of the northern guard tower for someone willing to travel.",["pending"]="{actor} would meet Mountaineer Stormpike at the northern tower.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Mountaineer Stormpike about his task.",["sourceHash"]="29447a48f0c90bc0a3c5268d33b5dbc3dcfc18e1bb0fd315d47ec94c9135a1de",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1358]={["aftermath"]="Helbrim welcomed its potential for further poison research, conditional on the reports proving true.",["atomIDs"]={"1358:description:1-118","1358:description:121-197","1358:description:202-275","1358:description:278-392","1358:description:395-461","1358:objective:1-65"},["bridge"]="The samples' next destination lay beyond Lordaeron. Helbrim was studying the effects of its toxins on Kalimdor's beasts, and Zinge wanted the wolf hearts carried to him at the Crossroads.",["bridgeAtomIDs"]={"1358:description:1-118","1358:description:121-197","1358:description:202-275","1358:description:278-392","1358:description:395-461","1358:objective:1-65"},["bridgeFrom"]=1359,["bridgeMinimumStage"]=2,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["bridgeSourceHash"]="f94abb1bbb72dc0900825c34c2cfe3acf7c0ed29ae2b90740f2f4022b8e9e437",["endingAtomIDs"]={"1358:completion:1-14","1358:completion:16-137","1358:completion:142-172","1358:completion:174-200"},["opening"]="Zinge saw the unusual wolf hearts as useful beyond Lordaeron. Helbrim's research into toxins affecting Kalimdor beasts made the Crossroads a destination for a sample.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to deliver the heart sample to Helbrim.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the material to the Barrens.",["sourceHash"]="f94abb1bbb72dc0900825c34c2cfe3acf7c0ed29ae2b90740f2f4022b8e9e437",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
