[1388]={["atomIDs"]={"1388:description:1-47","1388:description:49-151","1388:description:153-161","1388:description:166-170","1388:objective:1-69"},["opening"]="Faustin had prepared the serum and handed its administration onward. Zraedus was to receive the concoction and decide how it would reach the captive.",["pending"]="{actor} would give Faustin's Truth Serum to Zraedus.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Faustin's Truth Serum to Deathstalker Zraedus.",["sourceHash"]="8334a2c98ca94c283b3e14246d291fca8f4c616e3d2045f40ebc169c7d9172ba",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1389]={["atomIDs"]={"1389:description:1-88","1389:description:90-140","1389:description:143-252","1389:description:257-322","1389:description:327-475","1389:description:477-500","1389:objective:1-81"},["opening"]="Magtoor said the Lost Ones had stolen sacred crystals from their former brethren. Without them, the Harborage feared losing its own way after the journey to Azeroth.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover six stolen crystals.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the crystals to Magtoor.",["sourceHash"]="a980185ab6be116ef9bff33ca8df8c845f8f8480e10e5e24da7a052314e9e048",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1391]={["aftermath"]="Marksen welcomed the offered drink and proposed to speak after drinking. The recorded exchange stopped at that intention rather than supplying his later disclosures.",["atomIDs"]={"1391:description:1-55","1391:description:57-176","1391:description:181-245","1391:description:247-297","1391:description:299-386","1391:description:391-440","1391:description:442-486","1391:objective:1-54"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1391:completion:1-15","1391:completion:17-25","1391:completion:27-75","1391:completion:77-143"},["opening"]="Zraedus mixed Faustin's serum into ale, believing the prisoner would accept a drink more readily than a medicine. The disguised brew was bound for Infiltrator Marksen at Stonard, with secrecy urged for the delivery.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to carry Zraedus's Brew to Infiltrator Marksen.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Zraedus's Brew to Infiltrator Marksen in Stonard.",["sourceHash"]="dab9118f8103fa446fab2813c9ea7a4b01f16accf67e49e84af967099f1589cd",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1392]={["aftermath"]="Magtoor treated the weapon as welcome evidence against the raider who had threatened the settlement's survival.",["atomIDs"]={"1392:description:1-153","1392:objective:1-77"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1392:completion:1-49","1392:completion:51-66","1392:completion:71-109","1392:completion:111-217","1392:completion:219-303","1392:completion:308-352"},["opening"]="The weapon symbolized months of violence against the Harborage. Noboru's brutality had left the draenei without strength enough to confront him themselves.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to take the cudgel to the Harborage's leader.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Noboru's cudgel to Magtoor.",["sourceHash"]="16d7aa5782c83c46f7640d7d76361e0e23b7d0e7a6b98244fb93d7dc4c69391c",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1393]={["aftermath"]="A resin-filled keyhole could not be used, but Galen's hidden latch released the lid.",["atomIDs"]={"1393:description:1-12","1393:description:15-50","1393:description:55-110","1393:description:113-242","1393:description:247-295","1393:objective:1-94"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1393:completion:1-57","1393:completion:59-83","1393:completion:88-146","1393:completion:152-194","1393:completion:196-243"},["opening"]="Galen feared his captors meant to eat him. He promised the secret of a locked swamp strongbox if someone could first escort him out of danger.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to escort Galen and locate his strongbox.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Galen's escape and opened the box.",["sourceHash"]="9102c379e56c054a387b41609ed61390beb75a84ffec61f375635372743eeadc",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1394]={["aftermath"]="Dorn acknowledged the course of tests as finished and recognized the return to his home.",["atomIDs"]={"1394:description:1-23","1394:description:25-75","1394:description:77-111","1394:description:113-252","1394:description:257-322","1394:description:324-372","1394:objective:1-47"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1394:completion:9-73","1394:completion:75-170","1394:completion:175-229","1394:completion:231-247","1394:completion:249-264","1394:completion:266-330"},["opening"]="Parqual sent the completed trials back to Dorn. The journey closed where the first leap began, with judgment of the whole course still to come.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to return to Dorn in Thousand Needles.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} met Dorn after completing the trials.",["sourceHash"]="ebe45ce3f12ca3babac4dd646880ec62f34218a811939c966ffb5b9bce143632",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1395]={["atomIDs"]={"1395:description:1-80","1395:description:83-164","1395:description:169-219","1395:description:224-280","1395:description:283-422","1395:description:427-442","1395:description:445-507","1395:objective:1-88"},["opening"]="Sorigal's crate of powerstones could not wait for the next caravan: their stored power would expire. Quartermaster Lungertz needed them at Nethergarde Keep, beyond Deadwind Pass, the Swamp of Sorrows and the Blasted Lands.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to carry the powerstones to Lungertz before their power expired.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Crate of Powerstones to Quartermaster Lungertz within the quest's limit.",["sourceHash"]="cf5c6ab99af950a1deaaba09e671b0338631cec1e05cb4a3145c697b923b5836",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1396]={["aftermath"]="Biggs heard fewer animals nearby and hoped they would not return.",["atomIDs"]={"1396:description:1-77","1396:description:80-138","1396:description:143-173","1396:description:176-251","1396:description:254-300","1396:objective:1-127"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1396:completion:1-50","1396:completion:52-65","1396:completion:67-99"},["opening"]="Biggs alone had survived the attack on his caravan. He guarded its remaining supplies while swamp predators pressed close to the camp.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to drive the three kinds of beasts away.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the defense of Biggs's camp.",["sourceHash"]="8ac63506adec5feafe7525c1d97e7b79445d0268b38590096eea2207e91c3163",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1398]={["atomIDs"]={"1398:description:1-22","1398:description:25-60","1398:description:63-122","1398:description:127-187","1398:description:190-204","1398:description:206-222","1398:description:225-292","1398:description:297-377","1398:description:380-394","1398:objective:1-78"},["opening"]="Biggs's damaged wagon still stood between him and Nethergarde. Repair required dry, strong coastal wood rather than the swamp's spongy timber.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to gather eight pieces of sun-dried wood.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the driftwood to Biggs.",["sourceHash"]="31711729577ee3f0cccd6ee726cad62702a5d7befa8df453e999ee7314f0b210",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1418]={["aftermath"]="Neeka said she had sent an outrunner three days earlier and inferred failure from the report's absence.",["atomIDs"]={"1418:description:1-160","1418:description:165-183","1418:description:186-274","1418:description:277-328","1418:objective:1-27"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1418:completion:1-27","1418:completion:29-79","1418:completion:81-104","1418:completion:106-169","1418:completion:174-236"},["opening"]="Communication with Kargath often failed across harsh country near Alliance territory. Helgrum sought a report directly from its head scout.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to reach Neeka and request her news.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} met Neeka at Kargath.",["sourceHash"]="402aa03adca25fc46d4f8133a30d60d3c724d3d6ec39f7ceb420687b6064af91",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1419]={["atomIDs"]={"1419:description:1-45","1419:description:48-70","1419:description:72-126","1419:description:129-146","1419:description:151-181","1419:description:184-261","1419:description:264-301","1419:description:306-327","1419:description:330-367","1419:description:370-447","1419:objective:1-55"},["opening"]="Coyotes had grown bold enough to steal Kargath's food. Neeka made their jawbones both a bounty and a test of survival in the Badlands.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather thirty coyote jawbones.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the jawbones to Neeka.",["sourceHash"]="9496479fa94028e39fef45f67b01859875ba39399ef0ca4de1a63375bf04d366",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1420]={["aftermath"]="Helgrum read signs of Alliance difficulties and the possibility of enemies shared by both factions.",["atomIDs"]={"1420:description:1-46","1420:description:49-64","1420:description:69-136","1420:description:139-158","1420:objective:1-53"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1420:completion:1-14","1420:completion:16-87","1420:completion:89-144"},["opening"]="Neeka wrote a fresh report after the earlier courier's failure. Its return to Stonard would restore communication with Helgrum.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to carry Neeka's report to Stonard.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the report to Helgrum.",["sourceHash"]="1af361a9f32eee8105b789fcd6b470b871cb2001a05933ae5bcd327befda7527",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1421]={["aftermath"]="Biggs said the materials would let research linked to the Dark Portal continue, though he did not know its details.",["atomIDs"]={"1421:description:1-180","1421:description:185-307","1421:description:310-351","1421:description:354-383","1421:objective:1-104"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1421:completion:1-19","1421:completion:21-83","1421:completion:85-226"},["opening"]="Before losing consciousness, Biggs saw a wagon dragged toward the Fallow Sanctuary. Its chest contained reagents vital to Nethergarde's wizards.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover the reagents from the stolen wagon.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the wizards' reagents back to Biggs.",["sourceHash"]="0100491f9d896ab15f0630b8ab130a10e746ddf692860ef03a1506a857eb77b9",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1422]={["atomIDs"]={"1422:description:1-63","1422:description:65-257","1422:objective:1-39"},["opening"]="Tok'Kar needed time to craft the weapon. He pointed toward Katar, whose beach patrols required help against the surrounding threats.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to consult Katar at the outpost.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Katar by the coast.",["sourceHash"]="2567cbb17bf411da693c63c6cde10ee127a47ab4208515251cedd0cd72bb0a94",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1423]={["atomIDs"]={"1423:description:1-32","1423:description:35-82","1423:description:85-134","1423:description:139-160","1423:description:165-180","1423:objective:1-50"},["opening"]="A sturdy wax-sealed barrel carried a clear destination on its base. Lungertz's stamp tied the lost supplies to Nethergarde Keep.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to return the marked barrel.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the supplies to Lungertz.",["sourceHash"]="cfbeb30aad313ca606d05c96906a3c7cd3d1cf071cb11241f724f3ffd40f6fff",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1424]={["atomIDs"]={"1424:description:1-84","1424:description:89-173","1424:description:175-271","1424:description:276-350","1424:description:355-388","1424:description:390-451","1424:description:453-505","1424:objective:1-62"},["opening"]="Fel'zerul's investigation found a sunken temple guarded by green dragons. Artifacts from its surrounding pool might explain what had happened to the Atal'ai site.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather ten artifacts from the pool.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Fel'zerul with the artifacts.",["sourceHash"]="2dfa03ee5d160166a2a04eb203d2c8512ec580af644d206a8ec4a6dccdc504cf",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1425]={["aftermath"]="Lungertz had thought both caravan and driver lost. He hoped the package contained crystals his stores badly needed.",["atomIDs"]={"1425:description:1-57","1425:description:62-127","1425:description:130-159","1425:description:162-260","1425:description:265-306","1425:description:309-392","1425:description:395-427","1425:objective:1-80"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1425:completion:1-5","1425:completion:7-36","1425:completion:38-70","1425:completion:75-88","1425:completion:90-167","1425:completion:169-195"},["opening"]="Biggs packed the most vital rescued supplies while preparing to repair his wagon. Their route led south into the blasted country and onward to Nethergarde.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to take the shipment to Lungertz.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Biggs's shipment to the keep.",["sourceHash"]="5bf06c102df995540108684c5658e1d01f196b1877f7de3f42bf45b2868a7298",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1426]={["atomIDs"]={"1426:description:1-76","1426:description:78-133","1426:description:135-231","1426:description:233-330","1426:description:335-361","1426:description:363-384","1426:description:386-442","1426:objective:1-113"},["opening"]="Katar's hostility to the sea focused on its murlocs. He proposed a test against three kinds along the shore, seeking fewer enemies near the watch.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to confront the coastal murlocs for Katar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Katar's first shore assignment.",["sourceHash"]="c67a1041f78c22d7230c0165702ea3a29205e57a640cfa46cb5e647446828392",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1427]={["aftermath"]="Tok'Kar confirmed that more weapons had been completed for the fight against the murlocs.",["atomIDs"]={"1427:description:1-45","1427:description:47-102","1427:description:104-157","1427:description:159-239","1427:description:241-270","1427:objective:1-43"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1427:completion:1-24","1427:completion:26-30","1427:completion:32-101","1427:completion:103-218"},["opening"]="Katar believed Tok'Kar had finished crafting weapons during the patrol. He sent the return toward the cook and smith before any rest.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to speak with Tok'Kar again.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned to Tok'Kar at the outpost.",["sourceHash"]="9b18ce297cb86b9c1722d01d6280536ac471a11eeac91c9890e58367e73ce374",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1428]={["atomIDs"]={"1428:description:1-66","1428:description:71-165","1428:description:167-217","1428:objective:1-115"},["opening"]="Katar wanted the beach fighting to continue after the earlier patrol. Oracles joined inkspewers and flesheaters among his new targets.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to undertake Katar's further patrol.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the renewed assignment along the beach.",["sourceHash"]="58c39634c0e282779b6af6aeee03e46aca958040aaaf7b7fbf862990f1c545c1",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1429]={["aftermath"]="The exile recognized summoning artifacts and wondered whether Hakkar had returned; that question remained unanswered.",["atomIDs"]={"1429:description:1-129","1429:description:131-203","1429:description:208-280","1429:description:285-363","1429:description:368-397","1429:description:399-456","1429:description:458-500","1429:objective:1-78"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1429:completion:1-53","1429:completion:58-160","1429:completion:162-204","1429:completion:206-229"},["opening"]="A scout brought Fel'zerul a sentence written on dried flesh. It named an exiled Atal'ai priest whose knowledge might reveal the artifacts' actual use.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to take the bundle to the exile in the Hinterlands.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the artifacts to the exiled priest.",["sourceHash"]="a6b755e9ed3cb5ec888bfadecb94f1abd319018b29ae2e88dd5b46baad9a4a5b",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1430]={["atomIDs"]={"1430:description:1-130","1430:description:135-290","1430:description:295-429","1430:objective:1-63"},["opening"]="Dar's customers prized meat from the largest crawlers. He sought legs from the eastern coast for a shipment back to Orgrimmar.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather ten monstrous crawler legs.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the legs to Dar.",["sourceHash"]="f53537c801be5ec284cc8640bebdbb3d35b820e81a7aa82371db42bdae1ddc45",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1431]={["aftermath"]="Keldran introduced the problem as the Horde's appearance to its people, allies and enemies.",["atomIDs"]={"1431:description:1-101","1431:description:106-189","1431:description:191-274","1431:description:276-367","1431:description:372-470","1431:description:472-490","1431:objective:1-30"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1431:completion:1-13","1431:completion:15-47","1431:completion:49-72","1431:completion:77-248","1431:completion:253-346","1431:completion:348-357","1431:completion:362-392","1431:completion:394-419","1431:completion:421-442","1431:completion:444-488"},["opening"]="Craven framed Thrall's concern through diplomacy as well as pride. Keldran near the western gate could explain how knowledge of human ways mattered to the Horde's next task.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to hear Keldran's explanation.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} met the student of magic.",["sourceHash"]="d260ae8c10b72ddec0470d545db99b56c894f83bffdb6ce66913bc1eb9d27ba6",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1432]={["aftermath"]="Takata acknowledged that checking demons might indirectly aid centaur, but considered it his duty to the Horde.",["atomIDs"]={"1432:description:1-148","1432:description:150-190","1432:description:192-261","1432:description:266-362","1432:description:364-451","1432:description:453-496","1432:objective:1-39"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1432:completion:1-14","1432:completion:16-59","1432:completion:64-147","1432:completion:149-288","1432:completion:293-476"},["opening"]="Keldran feared observers would mistake local demonic activity for a new Horde pact. His agents at Ghost Walker Post were to remove that danger under the Warchief's authority.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to meet Takata in Desolace.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached the swordsman.",["sourceHash"]="584bee312191ade9ccc90bb19b09230b22e195d8912eaab5ba9185ec5bbf173c",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1433]={["aftermath"]="Maurin identified Keldran and Thrall as the authorities behind his mission.",["atomIDs"]={"1433:description:1-170","1433:description:175-263","1433:description:268-374","1433:description:379-429","1433:objective:1-41"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1433:completion:1-8","1433:completion:10-68","1433:completion:73-90","1433:completion:92-154","1433:completion:156-240","1433:completion:245-266","1433:completion:268-356"},["opening"]="Takata divided the work between demonic threats and Maurin's knowledge of the Burning Blade. The warlock would guide the part concerned with the cult's corrupted agendas.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to speak with Maurin.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} consulted the warlock.",["sourceHash"]="527b07e97fd512e84e2816910872ac3b6e81df2ad3a8c6b42c6ab229a57592f8",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1434]={["aftermath"]="Takata promised the Warchief would hear of the assistance when the campaign ended.",["atomIDs"]={"1434:description:1-107","1434:description:112-244","1434:description:246-323","1434:description:328-416","1434:description:418-503","1434:objective:1-139"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1434:completion:1-23","1434:completion:25-60","1434:completion:65-208","1434:completion:213-224"},["opening"]="Takata saw footholds for evil in suffering and the hunger for power or revenge. Reported ties between satyrs and the Burning Blade made the northeastern Hatefury his immediate target.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to confront the four Hatefury groups.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Takata's satyr assignment.",["sourceHash"]="0202661744fdb53d2bf58ea3084b88b6b0748ba56b4638df348248f7cfa4eeff",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1435]={["aftermath"]="Maurin said he would put them somewhere safe and passed further direction to Takata.",["atomIDs"]={"1435:description:1-116","1435:description:118-213","1435:description:218-231","1435:description:233-295","1435:description:297-387","1435:description:392-453","1435:description:458-489","1435:objective:1-86"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1435:completion:1-31","1435:completion:33-45","1435:completion:47-102","1435:completion:107-140","1435:completion:142-177","1435:completion:179-306"},["opening"]="Maurin required more than the cultists' deaths. His gem could pull a spirit from a nearly defeated member, creating infused objects he claimed he would dispose of properly.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to gather fifteen infused gems and return the tool.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the infused collection and burning gem.",["sourceHash"]="4c797e0caf452c9e5eb4515f1c92b26bb68aa73cb2e86ca42136c30222aadbfd",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1436]={["aftermath"]="Keldran welcomed measures that he believed would support Thrall's desired peace and avoid needless provocation.",["atomIDs"]={"1436:description:1-24","1436:description:26-205","1436:description:210-262","1436:description:264-314","1436:description:316-420","1436:objective:1-30"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1436:completion:1-57","1436:completion:59-68","1436:completion:73-145","1436:completion:147-342","1436:completion:347-367"},["opening"]="Takata judged the demon campaign progressing and hoped for an early return home. Keldran needed a report of what the distant agents had achieved.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to take the campaign's news to Orgrimmar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported to Keldran.",["sourceHash"]="36f6c9550fa858f6fea00644cd4d19d8029e123c957686ccfddffdafd05cdd01",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1437]={["aftermath"]="Signs of spells and weapons suggested a swift attack, but neither bodies nor blood established the travelers' fate.",["atomIDs"]={"1437:description:1-20","1437:description:22-131","1437:description:133-234","1437:description:236-331","1437:description:336-416","1437:description:421-478","1437:objective:1-62"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1437:completion:1-115","1437:completion:117-214","1437:completion:219-269"},["opening"]="Vahlarriel searched for two missing members of House Malem. Their last known passage through Stonetalon pointed the inquiry toward a wagon in Desolace.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to find and inspect the Malems' wagon.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} searched the missing nobles' wagon.",["sourceHash"]="4a3b3645e274e4b0eeacd04b1d974ec2383d52ac36e8c3b7467429f76cb5c776",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1438]={["aftermath"]="Dalinda identified the Burning Blade as their captors and feared both sacrifice and her brother's growing pursuit of forbidden knowledge.",["atomIDs"]={"1438:description:1-80","1438:description:82-116","1438:description:118-202","1438:description:207-261","1438:description:263-345","1438:description:347-421","1438:description:423-441","1438:description:443-473","1438:objective:1-31"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1438:completion:1-45","1438:completion:47-75","1438:completion:77-153","1438:completion:155-211","1438:completion:216-365","1438:completion:367-453","1438:completion:458-482"},["opening"]="Vahlarriel directed the search toward the fortress while alerting Darnassus. His superiors prioritized Dalinda's safety and wanted Tyranis's motives examined before his return.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to locate Dalinda in Desolace.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found Dalinda.",["sourceHash"]="fbef23ddfd832f66f3978dae2c4cd9b8a1a128ceacb6cf1acd7214d3fc385746",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1439]={["aftermath"]="Dalinda received the terrible news without easy gratitude and agreed that the time for escape had come.",["atomIDs"]={"1439:description:1-76","1439:description:78-118","1439:description:120-220","1439:description:225-259","1439:description:261-329","1439:description:331-347","1439:description:352-421","1439:description:423-477","1439:objective:1-31"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1439:completion:1-17","1439:completion:19-49","1439:completion:51-126","1439:completion:128-202","1439:completion:204-221","1439:completion:226-315","1439:completion:317-397","1439:completion:402-451"},["opening"]="Dalinda described the slaughter of their escort and Tyranis's attempt to address the captors. She refused to leave until his fate was known.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to find Tyranis and return with news.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the search and reported Tyranis's fate.",["sourceHash"]="9c33622fc19fab33cb57d82dcb7b1bf0b79bf8698985ce14b9bc2353af335c50",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1440]={["aftermath"]="Vahlarriel confirmed her safe arrival while acknowledging that Tyranis did not return.",["atomIDs"]={"1440:description:1-25","1440:description:27-175","1440:description:177-278","1440:objective:1-101"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1440:completion:1-14","1440:completion:16-123","1440:completion:125-191","1440:completion:193-211","1440:completion:216-342","1440:completion:344-416"},["opening"]="Dalinda was ready to leave the fortress when a safe opportunity presented itself. Her route led back to Vahlarriel and Nijel's Point.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to escort Dalinda out of Thunder Axe Fortress.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Dalinda's escort and returned to Vahlarriel.",["sourceHash"]="50db17da3148b2dd9e27eced4f8e85f2cbf7767626764365c84815f780d996aa",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1442]={["atomIDs"]={"1442:description:1-14","1442:description:16-61","1442:description:66-101","1442:description:103-116","1442:description:118-185","1442:description:190-283","1442:description:288-375","1442:description:377-440","1442:description:442-488","1442:description:490-509","1442:objective:1-52"},["opening"]="Thundris remembered Stilwell favorably and accepted the smith's desire for a Kor gem as well intentioned. Naga still used the stones below Blackfathom's ruins, where recovery would be dangerous.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring a Kor Gem to Thundris.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered a Kor Gem to Thundris Windweaver.",["sourceClassMask"]="2",["sourceHash"]="273f2cee46008f47de2842450510e706b16cd3daae2c6a5689be2f5abedf2bc9",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="5",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1444]={["atomIDs"]={"1444:description:1-75","1444:description:77-124","1444:description:129-213","1444:description:215-235","1444:description:240-321","1444:description:326-372","1444:description:374-489","1444:objective:1-31"},["opening"]="The exile blamed Jammal'an's unyielding prophecy for the danger facing the Atal'ai. The recovered objects were harmless by themselves, but a proper fetish enchantment could turn the summoning into a wider peril.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to take the warning back to Fel'zerul.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported the exile's findings in Stonard.",["sourceHash"]="17638bbac2e831c04e302af61bb64ab14f6726bbf4898d9a6cffcd71266d76fd",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1445]={["atomIDs"]={"1445:description:1-36","1445:description:41-175","1445:description:180-246","1445:description:251-300","1445:description:302-326","1445:description:328-444","1445:description:449-496","1445:objective:1-69"},["opening"]="Fel'zerul distrusted the promise of immortality attached to Hakkar's return. The exile's account of enchanted fetishes made their role in the Atal'ai ritual important enough to seize and study twenty.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to recover twenty Fetishes of Hakkar for Fel'zerul.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered twenty Fetishes of Hakkar to Fel'zerul.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="b27f5c7c3a596313d707b321de83676688fa1078d06ec82f77fc6b6fd2531939",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1446]={["atomIDs"]={"1446:description:1-74","1446:description:83-110","1446:description:112-188","1446:description:193-255","1446:description:257-336","1446:description:341-360","1446:description:362-417","1446:description:422-449","1446:description:451-476","1446:description:478-511","1446:objective:1-65"},["opening"]="The exile's caution about Jammal'an's prophecy had cost him a home among the Atal'ai. He suspected manipulation behind promised immortality and sought the prophet's death for revenge and a possible release of his people.",["pending"]="{actor} would obtain Jammal'an's head for the Atal'ai Exile.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Head of Jammal'an to the Atal'ai Exile.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="b6935c44f6aea798311b6bb53a65e31960542ec5d74897bf92018f5c8f72ed9f",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1447]={["aftermath"]="Stonefist was ready to hear the reason for the visit after the contest. The response supplied willingness to speak rather than the later disclosure itself.",["atomIDs"]={"1447:description:1-124","1447:description:129-152","1447:objective:1-37"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1447:completion:1-32","1447:completion:34-53"},["opening"]="Stonefist answered the inquiry by threatening the visitor and invoking his nearby friends. What Trias expected to be difficult persuasion had become a fight in Stormwind.",["pending"]="{actor} would defeat Dashel Stonefist.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the assignment to defeat Dashel Stonefist.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="de0be4a5cc6893fc08abd5049f9a752641f97ca6b3abaa90211abce57414fd66",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1448]={["atomIDs"]={"1448:description:1-65","1448:description:70-133","1448:description:135-155","1448:description:160-200","1448:description:202-290","1448:description:292-344","1448:description:349-442","1448:description:447-468","1448:description:470-511","1448:objective:1-81"},["opening"]="Age had ended Brohann's own search for Atal'Hakkar. His aerial scouting never found the temple rumored in the Swamp of Sorrows, leaving hope that someone on foot could finish the old expedition's task.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to search for the Temple of Atal'Hakkar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Brohann's search assignment for the Temple of Atal'Hakkar.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="40922fbe9a436426d03608c892862f95940b17bd65cb3c87af2399c62212f43b",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1449]={["atomIDs"]={"1449:description:1-79","1449:description:81-109","1449:description:114-188","1449:description:190-244","1449:description:246-297","1449:description:302-348","1449:description:350-399","1449:description:404-449","1449:description:454-501","1449:objective:1-74"},["opening"]="Brohann remembered that his temple flight had lost a gryphon pilot into the swamp. The pilot's name escaped him, but Falstad at Aerie Peak could identify the missing aviator.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to ask Falstad Wildhammer about the pilot.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with High Thane Falstad Wildhammer.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="d2f5302b2ac9438ad8bc34a357fc6693e2ec775011b711bbaa47e5d8d66960bf",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1450]={["aftermath"]="Talonaxe remembered assigning Rhapsody to Brohann's expedition and praised the rider's former skill.",["atomIDs"]={"1450:description:1-84","1450:description:89-114","1450:description:116-186","1450:description:188-233","1450:description:244-330","1450:description:332-421","1450:description:426-443","1450:objective:1-64"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1450:completion:1-8","1450:completion:10-99","1450:completion:104-164","1450:completion:166-259","1450:completion:264-335","1450:completion:337-385","1450:completion:390-422","1450:completion:424-436"},["opening"]="Falstad rejected the mistaken inquiry into flight assignments and sent it to the aviary's actual gryphon master. The search for an earlier expedition's rider needed the records of the person who dispatched him.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to speak with Talonaxe at the aviary.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached the gryphon master.",["sourceHash"]="aeacf0acfd008dd974eb2aab9fc7a4c0fea6d2fc5bcb01bf667d1b7f6e81f4e2",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1451]={["atomIDs"]={"1451:description:1-42","1451:description:44-148","1451:description:153-224","1451:description:226-256","1451:description:258-288","1451:description:293-389","1451:description:391-428","1451:description:430-447","1451:description:452-511","1451:objective:1-48"},["opening"]="Rhapsody's drinking had worsened after the swamp expedition until Talonaxe dismissed him. His last known destination was a brewing camp east of the aviary.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to locate the former rider.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found Rhapsody at his camp.",["sourceHash"]="6d3d83a1ded2ffd5f75fcf4f6f1ed78ff3e1e04fc63fc97ae53c839b4dd55529",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1452]={["aftermath"]="Rhapsody prepared to distill the drink before speaking of the expedition.",["atomIDs"]={"1452:description:1-7","1452:description:12-46","1452:description:48-85","1452:description:90-190","1452:description:192-224","1452:description:226-232","1452:description:237-251","1452:description:253-334","1452:description:339-382","1452:description:384-399","1452:description:401-447","1452:description:452-484","1452:description:486-508","1452:objective:1-116"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1452:completion:1-54","1452:completion:56-119","1452:completion:124-211","1452:completion:213-219","1452:completion:224-303","1452:completion:308-314","1452:completion:319-369","1452:completion:374-380","1452:completion:385-416"},["opening"]="Rhapsody required another drink before recounting the swamp. Ingredients from distant Tanaris and Feralas were his price for the account Brohann sought.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather the gizzards and two kinds of liver.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought all three ingredients to Rhapsody.",["sourceHash"]="92f3b222d909d6e417e4672f445d1746bc8f7f99c49418052b37f1c73a8a2d7e",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1453]={["atomIDs"]={"1453:description:1-40","1453:description:42-104","1453:description:106-223","1453:description:228-340","1453:description:342-399","1453:description:401-440","1453:objective:1-35"},["opening"]="Roetten offered a lead for work among Desolace's dangers. Kreldig waited at Nijel's Point, a camp easy to overlook in the northern mountains.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to speak with Kreldig Ungor in Desolace.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Kreldig Ungor at Nijel's Point.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="1640bf2ed9f9ad6dda55e8f21f46091de2e2604b837a9919062fddb77a13e75a",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1454]={["aftermath"]="The chest was dry but forced open, with scorch marks showing its magical safeguards were triggered.",["atomIDs"]={"1454:description:1-87","1454:description:89-179","1454:description:181-370","1454:description:375-456","1454:objective:1-34"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1454:completion:1-60","1454:completion:65-266"},["opening"]="Karnitol escaped attacking sea giants by teleporting his servants to safety. A valuable chest abandoned on Desolace's northwestern coast remained the Reclaimers' task.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to locate Karnitol's abandoned chest.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} found the chest on the coast.",["sourceHash"]="2d8fb714eba966f201087722321da01c7d3baf537a566b27978be50bd0d919b0",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1455]={["atomIDs"]={"1455:description:1-211","1455:description:213-277","1455:description:282-346","1455:description:351-428","1455:description:430-458","1455:objective:1-36"},["opening"]="Deep scratches marked the emptied chest. They suggested a creature rather than a person or giant, leaving Kreldig with evidence to interpret instead of recovered property.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to report the empty chest and its marks.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the findings back to Kreldig.",["sourceHash"]="fee0f3a7f614f3c94c90df2f8c5097e97163810328e1037e26f0c98c06bd0ea2",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1456]={["atomIDs"]={"1456:description:1-11","1456:description:16-60","1456:description:65-176","1456:description:178-233","1456:description:235-265","1456:description:270-349","1456:description:351-464","1456:objective:1-67"},["opening"]="Kreldig suspected the nearby Slitherblade and pointed toward submerged ruins. Stronger naga might have carried Karnitol's property away from the abandoned chest.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover Karnitol's satchel.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the recovered satchel to Kreldig.",["sourceHash"]="97a120ab67db6b542f96ecb11603150edb019807375c2c50cf1c6e60b39ce47b",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1457]={["atomIDs"]={"1457:description:1-90","1457:description:95-196","1457:description:201-221","1457:description:226-362","1457:objective:1-61"},["opening"]="Kreldig sent Karnitol's recovered belongings onward through the Reclaimers. Roetten in Ironforge would handle the return and settle the completed job.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to take the satchel to Roetten.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Karnitol's belongings in Ironforge.",["sourceHash"]="511aa9f73cc29d8161ee13601956c75d6f659456d13f86c95c176095fa8b26fe",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
