[1459]={["atomIDs"]={"1459:description:1-30","1459:description:32-43","1459:description:45-48","1459:description:50-64","1459:description:69-121","1459:description:123-181","1459:description:183-363","1459:description:368-415","1459:description:417-432","1459:objective:1-84"},["opening"]="Leftwitch's next requirements distinguished aged kodo from their dying and ancient kin. Kreldig needed those specific hides alongside scorpashi venom.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather the venom and aged kodo hides.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered both kinds of reagents to Kreldig.",["sourceHash"]="fed22356ceaa5aea4ee2739dcd3c4f69b9b5737fb062ad27a03da2263109ec30",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1465]={["aftermath"]="Vahlarriel identified the fortress as a Burning Blade holding and treated it as the next lead.",["atomIDs"]={"1465:description:1-120","1465:description:122-180","1465:description:182-329","1465:description:334-468","1465:objective:1-63"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1465:completion:1-12","1465:completion:14-32","1465:completion:37-105","1465:completion:107-133","1465:completion:135-143","1465:completion:148-196","1465:completion:198-222","1465:completion:227-370","1465:completion:372-500"},["opening"]="A pendant and southbound tracks added direction to the wagon search. A maintained fire at a distant fort offered a possible destination for the missing siblings.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring the pendant and findings to Vahlarriel.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Malem pendant and report.",["sourceHash"]="e0e2a6279c4ede1aa508fd323ea0b42cc74d37867305ccb904cbc9e973ef5a38",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1466]={["atomIDs"]={"1466:description:1-64","1466:description:66-142","1466:description:147-198","1466:description:200-289","1466:description:291-349","1466:description:351-356","1466:description:358-422","1466:description:427-445","1466:description:447-455","1466:description:457-502","1466:objective:1-105"},["opening"]="The final portion of Leftwitch's list demanded dangerous demonic materials. Kreldig warned that brains, wings and doomwarder blood would be harder to obtain.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to collect the three final demon reagents.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the brains, wings and blood to Kreldig.",["sourceHash"]="e48bc14be4ea58896ecb52c02df1f5218d16d6e5f75821b7834322c350c32600",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1467]={["atomIDs"]={"1467:description:1-85","1467:description:87-147","1467:description:149-209","1467:description:214-292","1467:description:294-332","1467:objective:1-67"},["opening"]="Kreldig packed the completed reagent order for Ironforge. Roetten would receive Leftwitch's package and settle the Reclaimers' business.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to carry the package to Roetten.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Leftwitch's package in Ironforge.",["sourceHash"]="adc46bec9961ab1c7e899103cf308ce477e8b25b785e9fd6a729994f9f334bc2",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1468]={["atomIDs"]={"1468:description:1-48","1468:description:51-120","1468:description:125-142","1468:description:145-254","1468:description:257-341","1468:description:344-381","1468:description:386-438","1468:description:441-490","1468:objective:1-101"},["opening"]="Nightingale offered a short-lived whistle to a volunteer for Children's Week. Its call would introduce the human child whose time outside the orphanage now needed a guardian.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to use the Human Orphan Whistle and meet the ward.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the first conversation with the human ward.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="432ea70e03be4b7866df4c46c33d4c7c11af1328d97e38bc25944be0f34a28b3",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1469]={["aftermath"]="Brohann accepted that Rhapsody had known the temple was submerged and recognized the artifact's value.",["atomIDs"]={"1469:description:1-51","1469:description:53-59","1469:description:64-88","1469:description:90-130","1469:description:132-159","1469:description:161-167","1469:description:172-250","1469:description:252-302","1469:description:304-355","1469:description:357-384","1469:description:386-424","1469:description:426-500","1469:description:502-508","1469:objective:1-68"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1469:completion:1-20","1469:completion:22-36","1469:completion:38-68","1469:completion:73-125","1469:completion:127-182","1469:completion:187-212","1469:completion:214-236"},["opening"]="Rhapsody said a drunken fall from his gryphon had revealed the temple beneath the water. A souvenir taken during his escape offered Brohann evidence beyond that uncertain expedition's original search.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring the tablet fragment and account to Brohann.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered both in Stormwind.",["sourceHash"]="eb22d9ea71816e8e4ac4587f1587f99eb27fba5f3418c71577d3e926e6d01cc1",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1470]={["atomIDs"]={"1470:description:1-17","1470:description:19-112","1470:description:114-149","1470:description:154-172","1470:description:177-210","1470:description:212-243","1470:description:245-352","1470:description:357-503","1470:objective:1-41"},["opening"]="Venya treated knowledge as the warlock's means of mastering chaos. Before teaching a bound servant, she demanded three skulls from the skeletons near the abandoned smithy as the first practical work.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring three Rattlecage Skulls to Venya.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered three Rattlecage Skulls to Venya Marthand.",["sourceClassMask"]="256",["sourceHash"]="70936e0cab0eae77bc8a2b4270066f923b978963baf84d2b830b88b56e85616a",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1472]={["atomIDs"]={"1472:description:1-71","1472:description:73-121","1472:description:126-180","1472:description:185-224","1472:description:226-345","1472:description:347-393","1472:description:398-456","1472:description:458-489","1472:objective:1-54"},["opening"]="Carendin described a succubus as dangerous both to souls and wills. He proposed luring it with loving, virtuous hearts and sent the search for such bait to his assistant Godrick.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to consult Godrick Farsan about the summoning bait.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Godrick Farsan in the Temple of the Damned.",["sourceClassMask"]="256",["sourceHash"]="55a810b012418aa9177662f4fa7ca4c08f3da71330ad773304d0d69325c42f4e",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1474]={["atomIDs"]={"1474:description:1-108","1474:description:110-191","1474:description:197-265","1474:description:267-390","1474:objective:1-138"},["opening"]="The collected hearts could open a door for the succubus at the circle. Carendin warned that mastering the creature required resisting its charms before the eventual command spell could be taught.",["pending"]="{actor} would summon and subdue a succubus, then return the Pure Hearts to Carendin.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the succubus binding assignment and returned the Pure Hearts to Carendin Halgar.",["sourceClassMask"]="256",["sourceHash"]="1755a02b816c8240316409ee12293d54953c2884ed5f3857a27e8cd7ff1c04e2",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1475]={["atomIDs"]={"1475:description:1-116","1475:description:118-217","1475:description:222-317","1475:description:319-355","1475:description:360-406","1475:description:408-473","1475:description:475-507","1475:objective:1-61"},["opening"]="Brohann's final temple inquiry turned toward intact artifacts beneath the Pool of Tears. Ten Atal'ai tablets could carry knowledge back from Hakkar's supposedly impenetrable shrine to the Explorers' League.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to recover ten Atal'ai Tablets for Brohann.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered ten Atal'ai Tablets to Brohann Caskbelly.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="0d195d9a7f24eab3aa36ed3fabaa06c9f8b6f8b3254b6ae0725a646e95740ce0",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1476]={["atomIDs"]={"1476:description:1-26","1476:description:28-49","1476:description:54-156","1476:description:161-308","1476:description:313-431","1476:description:436-468","1476:description:470-508","1476:objective:1-103"},["opening"]="Godrick's research selected two lives for the warlock's bait: Dalin, caring for refugees at Greymane Wall, and Comar, still seeking his lost wife in the Wetlands. Their goodness was precisely what made their hearts useful to the proposed summoning.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring the hearts of Dalin Forgewright and Comar Villard to Carendin.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Dalin Forgewright's and Comar Villard's hearts to Carendin Halgar.",["sourceClassMask"]="256",["sourceHash"]="dce5cf92695fffde9f6b4fc4f3b7b247542c0bc95dcebf53e7a83e62922ad963",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1477]={["atomIDs"]={"1477:description:1-132","1477:description:134-218","1477:description:223-278","1477:description:281-342","1477:description:345-391","1477:description:394-410","1477:objective:1-31"},["opening"]="Nethergarde's research into the Dark Portals depended on nearly constant supplies. Its fragile route drew Andromath's attention to Sorigal in Darkshire, who could direct the next delivery.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to report to Watchmaster Sorigal.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Watchmaster Sorigal.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="1cb16888488fabfcb89bc2cbb8c7a7a9136fc0756fd5d3103332c254710de434",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1478]={["atomIDs"]={"1478:description:9-101","1478:description:106-141","1478:description:143-228","1478:description:233-328","1478:objective:1-44"},["opening"]="Ageron relayed Carendin's personal summons for further training. The invitation led to the Magic Quarter near the Temple of the Damned.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to meet Carendin Halgar in Undercity.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Carendin Halgar.",["sourceClassMask"]="256",["sourceHash"]="b3dc44cf5e7bb477cb1ff2c7dcfdc016875e36c1ec1744a3ea544c89c1c2bdbd",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1479]={["atomIDs"]={"1479:description:1-100","1479:description:103-117","1479:description:120-207","1479:description:212-271","1479:description:274-354","1479:description:357-379","1479:objective:1-41","1479:objective:44-120"},["opening"]="The ward's stories of Darnassus fixed on a bank shaped like a bear. The living tree called the Bough of the Eternals promised a sight the child wanted to see beyond the orphanage's familiar world.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to take the ward to Darnassus's bank.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the ward's visit to the Bough of the Eternals.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="bddb9091cd76b25343924b98be03a7d119bdf5c0bed4a62fdf6cf79324dd74de",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1480]={["aftermath"]="Maurin tentatively identified a contract in an old language and read the signature as Lord Azrethoc's.",["atomIDs"]={"1480:description:1-104","1480:description:109-200","1480:description:202-293","1480:description:298-354","1480:objective:1-63"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1480:completion:1-60","1480:completion:62-144","1480:completion:146-202","1480:completion:204-266"},["opening"]="The flayed skin bore red markings and a possible signature. Its strange writing offered a reason to seek Maurin's interpretation.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to show the demon skin to Maurin.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the skin to Maurin.",["sourceHash"]="1021324ad397a8103929681f57beef4dfdde193bde5dd54a2f87cb9073771f61",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1481]={["aftermath"]="Maurin had assembled other reagents and still required a focus for the image.",["atomIDs"]={"1481:description:1-63","1481:description:68-158","1481:description:160-232","1481:description:237-297","1481:description:299-362","1481:description:364-413","1481:description:418-486","1481:objective:1-63"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1481:completion:1-47","1481:completion:49-61","1481:completion:63-78","1481:completion:83-121","1481:completion:123-212","1481:completion:217-234","1481:completion:236-338"},["opening"]="Maurin believed the demon could be found through scrying, but first needed to break its wards. A Hatefury shadowstalker's scalp was the first reagent.",["pending"]="{actor} sought a shadowstalker's scalp for Maurin's spell.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Maurin with the scalp.",["sourceHash"]="a68a775dfab3c5458aec22e065dfc2ec927021d513c7a3a404d05834853e7631",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1482]={["aftermath"]="Maurin accepted its quality and prepared to reveal the demon and its location.",["atomIDs"]={"1482:description:1-34","1482:description:36-89","1482:description:94-218","1482:description:220-252","1482:description:254-356","1482:description:361-429","1482:objective:1-59"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1482:completion:1-28","1482:completion:30-40","1482:completion:42-51","1482:completion:53-59","1482:completion:64-90","1482:completion:92-191","1482:completion:196-278"},["opening"]="Maurin chose a naga oracle's crystal as the spell's focus. Slitherblade oracles along the northwestern reef held the required object.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover an oracle crystal.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the crystal to Maurin.",["sourceHash"]="7c0da029b6f9bf822f7f2bbc6ff0389cd1e535ced11f0aa8dba13654058bba89",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1483]={["atomIDs"]={"1483:description:1-122","1483:description:127-231","1483:description:233-365","1483:description:367-415","1483:description:420-457","1483:description:459-511","1483:objective:1-41"},["opening"]="Sputtervalve had found work for Ziz after the company's decision to hire Gerenzo. He now wanted someone to check on his new employee's tasks.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to find Ziz at Windshear Crag.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Ziz at his camp.",["sourceHash"]="cc9e9b19abfd05de20d65db0da526da24cae5de7f47b0648b0de3dbdaaefaa77",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1484]={["aftermath"]="Takata had witnessed the apparition and doubted Maurin's power against it, but would not abandon his own duties to pursue personal honor.",["atomIDs"]={"1484:description:1-59","1484:description:62-207","1484:description:212-326","1484:description:328-369","1484:objective:1-39"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1484:completion:1-62","1484:completion:64-152","1484:completion:154-210","1484:completion:212-397"},["opening"]="The apparition had exceeded Maurin's expectations. He sent word to Takata rather than challenge the swordsman's honor by excluding him from the decision.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to consult Takata about the demon.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Takata.",["sourceHash"]="f0f546ba23d1b6eed33ebaafaa5b06a27de61930943cd0ec4f462c94059252c5",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1488]={["aftermath"]="Takata welcomed the victory as grounds for hope; a secure home remained a future aspiration.",["atomIDs"]={"1488:description:1-186","1488:description:191-330","1488:description:335-424","1488:objective:1-83"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1488:completion:1-32","1488:completion:34-64","1488:completion:66-132","1488:completion:137-270"},["opening"]="Takata agreed that Azrethoc must be stopped, especially if he sought influence over the Burning Blade. The demon's warlock servant was part of the same assignment.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to confront Azrethoc and Jugkar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} fulfilled the assignment and returned to Takata.",["sourceHash"]="e77b00ebfc5fe05f343eebcc4297fae5061236569a045168159439a5e4972150",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1489]={["aftermath"]="Hamuul welcomed the visitor and urged the gathering of strength for the grave task he intended to set next.",["atomIDs"]={"1489:description:1-69","1489:description:72-172","1489:description:175-219","1489:description:224-275","1489:description:278-347","1489:description:350-401","1489:description:404-441","1489:description:446-499","1489:objective:1-28"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1489:completion:1-24","1489:completion:26-90","1489:completion:92-129","1489:completion:131-144"},["opening"]="Tonga sensed a new taint in the shells and attributed it to the oasis water. He pictured a land unable to wake from dreams and sent counsel-seeking to Hamuul before an entry into Wailing Caverns.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to consult Hamuul Runetotem in Thunder Bluff.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="fdd5b767e4e7adcae2e094246c0537061272f254f9c4ef0fc64fc652a41c98a2",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1490]={["aftermath"]="Nara confirmed knowledge of the caverns' druids, including their altered faces and plans. She called for an end to what they were doing.",["atomIDs"]={"1490:description:1-95","1490:description:98-166","1490:description:169-231","1490:description:236-266","1490:description:269-357","1490:description:360-402","1490:description:405-445","1490:description:450-465","1490:description:468-499","1490:objective:1-25"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1490:completion:1-16","1490:completion:18-61","1490:completion:63-102","1490:completion:104-147","1490:completion:152-174"},["opening"]="Hamuul's dream showed druids whose noble purpose had become service to the Barrens' taint. His strength failed before he could learn much, but Nara had remained in the dreaming and might know more.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to speak with Nara Wildmane.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Nara Wildmane.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="addb81a59f046eb68717bf246a2afbc7f17f1e8ec37b2ccbc999c86e33fc6d7e",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1491]={["aftermath"]="Mebok welcomed the essence and expected the new experiment to make his fortune. His confidence did not yet establish that the drink would work.",["atomIDs"]={"1491:description:1-44","1491:description:47-105","1491:description:108-190","1491:description:195-316","1491:description:319-358","1491:description:363-450","1491:description:453-496","1491:objective:1-65"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1491:completion:1-18","1491:completion:20-46","1491:completion:48-98","1491:completion:103-116","1491:completion:118-177"},["opening"]="Mebok's earlier raptor-horn drink had failed. He now suspected Wailing Essence caused the Barrens' unusual life and wanted to try the substance in a new batch, using material from the caverns' ectoplasmic creatures.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to gather six Wailing Essence portions for Mebok.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered six portions of Wailing Essence to Mebok Mizzyrix.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="3e97920020ace045c6f052f6c5ed2759ab09f375963b976d2760aa82ab1f41d7",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1492]={["aftermath"]="Dizzywig entered the cargo into his ledger for the ship leaving with the next tide.",["atomIDs"]={"1492:description:1-99","1492:description:101-202","1492:description:207-261","1492:description:263-331","1492:objective:1-58"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"1492:completion:1-21","1492:completion:23-82","1492:completion:84-140","1492:completion:142-151","1492:completion:153-188","1492:completion:193-210","1492:completion:212-231"},["opening"]="Helbrim's last caravan had already left. His crate of potions and reagents still needed to reach Ratchet for shipment to Old World associates.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring Helbrim's crate to Dizzywig.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the secure crate at the docks.",["sourceHash"]="b09951083df3413de00468a0d6f64896ecda1cb3fe8e88733cbdb975fa748ad5",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1498]={["atomIDs"]={"1498:description:1-49","1498:description:51-61","1498:description:64-132","1498:description:135-205","1498:description:210-292","1498:description:295-310","1498:description:313-346","1498:description:349-422","1498:description:427-461","1498:objective:1-64"},["opening"]="Uzzek framed the warrior's work as protection of weaker companions. Singed scales from Thunder Ridge's lizards would prove the ability to endure attacks before he taught the promised defense.",["pending"]="{actor} would bring five Singed Scales to Uzzek.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered five Singed Scales to Uzzek.",["sourceClassMask"]="1",["sourceHash"]="d2b1dda553be7368f5876dd3a255a7a396f20fa698ec45832b9642c5f10caab2",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1501]={["atomIDs"]={"1501:description:1-25","1501:description:27-68","1501:description:70-174","1501:description:179-228","1501:description:233-395","1501:description:397-475","1501:objective:1-63"},["opening"]="Gan'rul wanted the warlock's power developed quickly for the Horde. The Burning Blade held the stolen Tablet of Verga at Skull Rock, and its runes were needed for a voidwalker summoning.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover the Tablet of Verga.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Tablet of Verga to Gan'rul Bloodeye.",["sourceClassMask"]="256",["sourceHash"]="c176b89672d1eb624be8c6ab0853b2f05fff6115586a2b50324d2504bbac83cc",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[1502]={["atomIDs"]={"1502:description:1-54","1502:description:57-146","1502:description:149-212","1502:description:217-278","1502:description:281-369","1502:description:372-401","1502:objective:1-45"},["opening"]="A warrior's weapon required a craftsman Uzzek trusted. Thun'grim lived as a hermit high in the hills east of the Crossroads, where quality steel might be sought.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to speak with Thun'grim Firegaze.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Thun'grim Firegaze in the Barrens.",["sourceClassMask"]="1",["sourceHash"]="94a8e567fc26652a1acca8978e30ae714ab0d36572669063bda174e50344356b",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
